ox Publisher&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;kafka.produce('jobs.run', key=X, value=payload, acks=all)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;28 ms&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Replicates to 3 brokers, returns ack.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;30 ms&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Outbox Publisher&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;UPDATE outbox SET status='sent' WHERE id=row.id&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;50 ms&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Job Consumer Svc&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Polls Kafka, receives the event.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;60 ms&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Job Consumer Svc&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Routes to Executor.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;100 ms&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Executor&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 221.089px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;UPDATE jobs SET status='RUNNING' WHERE id=X AND status='QUEUED'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(CAS). Begins user code.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Total commit-to-execution: ~100 ms. Well within the 2 s p99 budget. The outbox added ~10 ms vs the broken-but-fast direct produce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;8. The crash-recovery scenarios&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;This is what makes the pattern airtight. Three crash points to reason through:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Crash before COMMIT (step 8 fails)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ nothing committed, no outbox row, no Kafka message. Client gets 5xx, retries with their idempotency key.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Crash between COMMIT and Kafka produce (steps 8 → 18)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ outbox row exists with&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;status='pending'&lt;/code&gt;. Some new Outbox Publisher pod's CDC stream / poll picks it up. Replays. Job dispatches with extra latency (probably &amp;lt;1 s).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Crash between Kafka ack and&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;status='sent'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(steps 28 → 30)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ outbox row still says pending → publisher republishes → Kafka has duplicate message → Job Consumer Svc dispatches twice → Executor's CAS&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;status: QUEUED → RUNNING&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;succeeds for the first, the second's CAS fails (status is already RUNNING/SUCCEEDED) → second dispatch is a no-op.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Idempotency saves us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;This is why&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;kafka_key = job_id&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;matters: same partition, same consumer, same dedup window.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;In none of these cases does the job get silently lost. That's the whole point.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;9. Why I made this its own (NEW) box&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Three reasons to separate &quot;Outbox Publisher&quot; from &quot;Job Service&quot; on the diagram:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol class=&quot;list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;ordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: decimal; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Different failure isolation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Publisher can crash, restart, fall behind, be stopped for an upgrade — none of those affect Job Service availability. The outbox row is the buffer.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Different scaling profile.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Job Svc scales with API request rate. Outbox Publisher scales with publish throughput, which is&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;the same as&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;commit throughput, but separate workload (CPU on serialization + Kafka network). Often one publisher pod handles thousands of msg/s easily.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Visibility of the pattern.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;A reviewer scanning the diagram sees an outbox table, a separate publisher box, and the green&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;(NEW)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;label, and immediately understands:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;oh good, they're not doing dual writes; they're doing the outbox pattern.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;That's the kind of thing senior reviewers look for.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;10. The trade-offs to know&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area&quot; data-visibility=&quot;hover&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; --scrollbar-size: 6px; --scrollbar-inset: 0px; --scrollbar-thumb-top-offset: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr; margin: 1em 0px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__viewport&quot; style=&quot;grid-area: 1 / 1; min-height: 0px; max-height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; overflow: auto hidden; scroll-padding: 0px 4px; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; width: auto; min-width: 100%; max-width: 100%; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content;&quot;&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;color: inherit; font-size: inherit; border-collapse: collapse; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; --markdown-table-prose-cell-inline-size: 20ch;&quot;&gt;&lt;thead class=&quot;bg-muted/80&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-header&quot; style=&quot;background: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-header-cell&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline: 16px; padding-block: 8px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.42857; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; padding: 5px 9px; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;Aspect&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-header-cell&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline: 16px; padding-block: 8px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.42857; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; padding: 5px 9px; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;Outbox pattern&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-header-cell&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline: 16px; padding-block: 8px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.42857; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; padding: 5px 9px; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;Direct dual write&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-header-cell&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline: 16px; padding-block: 8px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.42857; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; padding: 5px 9px; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;2PC/XA&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody class=&quot;divide-y divide-border bg-muted/40&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-body&quot;&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Atomicity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;✅ via Postgres txn&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;❌ broken&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;✅ if it works&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Latency added&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;+10–500 ms (publisher hop)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;0 (broken though)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;+20–100 ms (txn coordination)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Operational complexity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Medium (outbox table, publisher, optional Debezium)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Lowest (but broken)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Highest (XA, RM, fragile)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Failure modes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;At-least-once on Kafka wire, exactly-once-effect with idempotent consumers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Silent loss / phantom / dup&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Hangs on coordinator failure&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;What can go wrong&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Outbox table grows if publisher is down → set up alerts on&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;pending&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;lag&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Everything&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 163.77px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Distributed transaction stuck mid-commit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The standard ops alert:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;SELECT max(now() - created_at) FROM outbox WHERE status='pending'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; 30 s → page someone. That's how you know the publisher is broken.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;11. The one-line summary for an interview&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote class=&quot;my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;blockquote&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; padding: 8px 0px 8px 16px; font-style: italic; margin: 0.5rem 0px; border-left: 2.91667px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.12); background: rgb(31, 31, 31); color: rgb(204, 204, 204); word-break: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;The Outbox Publisher exists because writing to Postgres and producing to Kafka in two separate steps is unsafe — any crash between them causes silent data loss or phantom events. We instead write the dispatch intent into an&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;outbox&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;table in the same Postgres transaction as the business row, and a separate publisher process (Debezium CDC) tails the outbox and produces to Kafka with idempotent producer + acks=all. That gives us atomicity between Postgres and Kafka with at-least-once delivery on the wire, plus exactly-once-effect downstream because every Kafka message is keyed by job_id and consumers dedupe with a CAS on&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename&quot;&gt;jobs.status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" link="&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;1. The bug it fixes (the dual-write problem)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;In your v1 whiteboard there was an arrow&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;Job Svc → Kafka 2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for fast/immediate jobs. That's the classic&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;dual-write problem&lt;/span&gt;, and it's broken. Conceptually the Job Service was doing this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 86px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; min-height: 86px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area&quot; data-visibility=&quot;hover&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot; style=&quot;--scrollbar-size: 6px; --scrollbar-inset: 1px; --scrollbar-thumb-top-offset: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__viewport&quot; style=&quot;grid-area: 1 / 1; min-height: 0px; max-height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; overflow: auto hidden; scroll-padding: 0px 4px; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; max-width: none; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code ui-code-block-default-code&quot; style=&quot;min-width: 100%; width: max-content; background: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 96px; padding: 6px 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; contain: layout style paint; tab-size: 4; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --shiki-foreground: #cccccc; --shiki-background: transparent; --shiki-token-constant: #f8c762; --shiki-token-string: #CE9178; --shiki-token-comment: #6A9955; --shiki-token-keyword: #569CD6; --shiki-token-parameter: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-function: #DCDCAA; --shiki-token-string-expression: #CE9178; --shiki-token-punctuation: #cccccc; --shiki-token-link: #87c3ff; --shiki-token-tag: #569CD6; --shiki-token-attribute: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-property: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-type: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-variable: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-class: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-language-variable: #569CD6; --shiki-token-constant-variable: #4FC1FF; --ui-default-code-tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__content&quot; style=&quot;min-width: fit-content; contain: layout style;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(220, 220, 170);&quot;&gt;submit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(156, 220, 254);&quot;&gt;job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;    db&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;execute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;INSERT INTO jobs (...) VALUES (...)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(106, 153, 85); font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;# write 1: Postgres&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;fire_at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; 5_min&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;        kafka&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;produce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;jobs.run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;                   &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(106, 153, 85); font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;# write 2: Kafka&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;These are two independent writes to two independent systems with no coordinator between them. Walk through the failure modes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area&quot; data-visibility=&quot;hover&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; --scrollbar-size: 6px; --scrollbar-inset: 0px; --scrollbar-thumb-top-offset: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr; margin: 1em 0px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__viewport&quot; style=&quot;grid-area: 1 / 1; min-height: 0px; max-height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; overflow: auto hidden; scroll-padding: 0px 4px; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; width: auto; min-width: 100%; max-width: 100%; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content;&quot;&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;color: inherit; font-size: inherit; border-collapse: collapse; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; --markdown-table-prose-cell-inline-size: 40ch;&quot;&gt;&lt;thead class=&quot;bg-muted/80&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-header&quot; style=&quot;background: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-header-cell&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline: 16px; padding-block: 8px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.42857; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; padding: 5px 9px; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;What happens&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-sm&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-header-cell&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline: 16px; padding-block: 8px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.42857; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; padding: 5px 9px; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;Result&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody class=&quot;divide-y divide-border bg-muted/40&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-body&quot;&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 327.539px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Postgres commits, Kafka fails&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 327.539px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Row exists in DB, no dispatch ever happens.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Silent job loss.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 327.539px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Postgres rolls back, Kafka already produced&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 327.539px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Phantom dispatch with no source-of-truth row.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Phantom run.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 327.539px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Postgres commits, process crashes before&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename&quot;&gt;kafka.produce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 327.539px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Same as case 1. Silent loss.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 327.539px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Kafka producer ack times out, app retries, both produces actually succeeded&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 327.539px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Duplicate dispatch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class=&quot;border-border border-b&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;table-row&quot; style=&quot;border: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: 0.833333px solid color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-bottom: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 327.539px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Network split between app and Kafka after Postgres commit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 5px 9px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-right: none; border-bottom: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-table-cell-content&quot; style=&quot;display: block; min-inline-size: 6ch; max-inline-size: 327.539px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal;&quot;&gt;Same as case 1.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;There is no way to fix this with retry logic. You need either:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol class=&quot;list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;ordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: decimal; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;2-phase commit / XA transactions across Postgres + Kafka&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;— possible, fragile, performance disaster.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;The transactional outbox pattern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;— what v2 does.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;2. The transactional outbox pattern in one paragraph&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Instead of writing to Kafka directly, the Job Service writes the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;intent to publish&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as a row in a normal Postgres table called&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;outbox&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;inside the same transaction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the business write. Postgres gives you ACID atomicity for free between the two rows in the same transaction. Then a&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;separate process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;— the Outbox Publisher — tails the outbox table and is the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;only thing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;that actually talks to Kafka. The outbox row is the durable, crash-safe record of &quot;this message must reach Kafka eventually.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 526px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; min-height: 526px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area&quot; data-visibility=&quot;hover&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot; style=&quot;--scrollbar-size: 6px; --scrollbar-inset: 1px; --scrollbar-thumb-top-offset: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__viewport&quot; style=&quot;grid-area: 1 / 1; min-height: 0px; max-height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; overflow: auto hidden; scroll-padding: 0px 4px; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; max-width: none; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code ui-code-block-default-code&quot; style=&quot;min-width: 100%; width: max-content; background: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 536px; padding: 6px 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; contain: layout style paint; tab-size: 4; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --shiki-foreground: #cccccc; --shiki-background: transparent; --shiki-token-constant: #f8c762; --shiki-token-string: #CE9178; --shiki-token-comment: #6A9955; --shiki-token-keyword: #569CD6; --shiki-token-parameter: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-function: #DCDCAA; --shiki-token-string-expression: #CE9178; --shiki-token-punctuation: #cccccc; --shiki-token-link: #87c3ff; --shiki-token-tag: #569CD6; --shiki-token-attribute: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-property: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-type: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-variable: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-class: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-language-variable: #569CD6; --shiki-token-constant-variable: #4FC1FF; --ui-default-code-tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__content&quot; style=&quot;min-width: fit-content; contain: layout style;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                 ┌────────── ONE Postgres transaction ──────────┐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                 │                                              │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Job Svc  ───────►│  INSERT INTO jobs   (id, fire_at, status, …) │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                 │  INSERT INTO outbox (job_id, topic, key,     │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                 │                      payload, 'pending')     │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                 │  COMMIT                                      │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                 └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                                     │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                                     ▼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              ┌──────────────┐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              │   outbox     │  (durable in Postgres)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              │  table       │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              └──────┬───────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                                     │  Debezium CDC (or poll)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                                     ▼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              ┌──────────────┐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              │   Outbox     │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              │  Publisher   │  ◄── this is the (NEW) box&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              └──────┬───────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                                     │  produce, acks=all,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                                     │  enable.idempotence=true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                                     ▼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              ┌──────────────┐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              │   Kafka 2    │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              │  jobs.run    │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              └──────────────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Postgres is now the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;single source of truth for &quot;did this happen&quot;&lt;/span&gt;. Kafka is just the transport. If the message reaches Kafka, great. If not yet, the outbox row says so and the publisher will retry until it does.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;3. Where it's used in v2 (and where it's NOT used)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;This is the most-misunderstood part of the diagram, so let me be explicit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;The hot dispatch path for&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;future&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;jobs does NOT go through the outbox.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;That path is:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 26px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; min-height: 26px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area&quot; data-visibility=&quot;hover&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot; style=&quot;--scrollbar-size: 6px; --scrollbar-inset: 1px; --scrollbar-thumb-top-offset: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__viewport&quot; style=&quot;grid-area: 1 / 1; min-height: 0px; max-height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; overflow: auto hidden; scroll-padding: 0px 4px; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; max-width: none; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code ui-code-block-default-code&quot; style=&quot;min-width: 100%; width: max-content; background: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 36px; padding: 6px 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; contain: layout style paint; tab-size: 4; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --shiki-foreground: #cccccc; --shiki-background: transparent; --shiki-token-constant: #f8c762; --shiki-token-string: #CE9178; --shiki-token-comment: #6A9955; --shiki-token-keyword: #569CD6; --shiki-token-parameter: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-function: #DCDCAA; --shiki-token-string-expression: #CE9178; --shiki-token-punctuation: #cccccc; --shiki-token-link: #87c3ff; --shiki-token-tag: #569CD6; --shiki-token-attribute: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-property: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-type: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-variable: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-class: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-language-variable: #569CD6; --shiki-token-constant-variable: #4FC1FF; --ui-default-code-tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__content&quot; style=&quot;min-width: fit-content; contain: layout style;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Job Svc ─INSERT─► Postgres ─Watcher scan─► Redis ZSET ─Picker tick─► Kafka 2 ─consume─► Executor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__scrollbar&quot; data-scrollable=&quot;true&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;position: absolute; z-index: 10; inset: auto 1px 1px; width: auto; pointer-events: auto; height: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__thumb&quot; style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0px auto 0px 0px; min-height: auto; width: 674px; border-radius: 9999px; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); pointer-events: auto; transform: translateX(0px); transition: background-color 0.15s, opacity 0.15s; height: 6px; min-width: 20px; opacity: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The Picker is the producer to Kafka 2 in steady state. The outbox isn't on that path — it would add unnecessary latency to a path that already has the Picker doing the produce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;The outbox is used for the four cases that&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;don't&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;fit the &quot;wait until fire_at&quot; pattern:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol class=&quot;list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;ordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: decimal; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;POST /jobs/{id}/runNow&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;— user wants the job to fire&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;right now&lt;/em&gt;. Can't wait for the 1-min Watcher tick. Job Svc must produce to Kafka 2 immediately. Going direct is the v1 bug → use outbox.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Submit with&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;fire_at ≤ now&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(immediate jobs). Same logic as runNow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Reconciliation / failsafe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;If a job is stuck in&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;QUEUED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;in Postgres but for some reason isn't in the Redis ZSET (hot tier was wiped, Watcher fell behind, Picker crashed for that shard) → some reconciler inserts into outbox → publisher re-emits to Kafka 2. This is the &quot;republish (failsafe)&quot; arrow on the diagram.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; word-break: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Job lifecycle events for downstream consumers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Billing, audit, search indexing, customer-facing webhooks, etc. all want to know when a job was created, succeeded, failed. Those events go through the outbox so they're never lost.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;For all four cases, the property &quot;Postgres commit ⟺ Kafka eventually receives the message&quot; is the value the outbox is providing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;4. What an outbox row looks like&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;From the diagram (cell 16):&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 206px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; min-height: 206px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area&quot; data-visibility=&quot;hover&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot; style=&quot;--scrollbar-size: 6px; --scrollbar-inset: 1px; --scrollbar-thumb-top-offset: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__viewport&quot; style=&quot;grid-area: 1 / 1; min-height: 0px; max-height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; overflow: auto hidden; scroll-padding: 0px 4px; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; max-width: none; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code ui-code-block-default-code&quot; style=&quot;min-width: 100%; width: max-content; background: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 216px; padding: 6px 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; contain: layout style paint; tab-size: 4; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --shiki-foreground: #cccccc; --shiki-background: transparent; --shiki-token-constant: #f8c762; --shiki-token-string: #CE9178; --shiki-token-comment: #6A9955; --shiki-token-keyword: #569CD6; --shiki-token-parameter: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-function: #DCDCAA; --shiki-token-string-expression: #CE9178; --shiki-token-punctuation: #cccccc; --shiki-token-link: #87c3ff; --shiki-token-tag: #569CD6; --shiki-token-attribute: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-property: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-type: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-variable: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-class: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-language-variable: #569CD6; --shiki-token-constant-variable: #4FC1FF; --ui-default-code-tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__content&quot; style=&quot;min-width: fit-content; contain: layout style;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;CREATE TABLE outbox (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;    id            BIGSERIAL    PRIMARY KEY,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;    job_id        UUID         NOT NULL REFERENCES jobs(id),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;    kafka_topic   TEXT         NOT NULL,    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(106, 153, 85); font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;-- e.g. 'jobs.run', 'jobs.lifecycle'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;    kafka_key     TEXT         NOT NULL,    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(106, 153, 85); font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;-- typically = job_id (for partitioning + dedup)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;    kafka_payload JSONB        NOT NULL,    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(106, 153, 85); font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;-- exactly the bytes you want on the wire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;        TEXT         NOT NULL,    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(106, 153, 85); font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;-- 'pending' | 'sent'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;    created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;CREATE INDEX outbox_pending_idx ON outbox (created_at) WHERE &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;pending&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Notice you store the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;exact bytes you want on the wire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;plus the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;topic and partitioning key&lt;/span&gt;. This is critical — it decouples your Kafka event schema from your DB schema. You can change your&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;jobs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;table without breaking your event consumers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;5. Two implementation flavors&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Flavor A — Polling publisher (simpler, what most teams ship first):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31