gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;       (Watcher tick scans Postgres)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;              Redis ZSET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;           Picker pops at fire_at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;              Kafka&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The Kafka publish happens&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;at fire_at&lt;/span&gt;, not at submit time. The Picker is an&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;async&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;producer — if Kafka is down at submit time, it's not relevant; we only need Kafka to be up at fire_at. There's nothing for the outbox to deliver &quot;atomically with the Postgres insert&quot; because&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;the Kafka event isn't due yet&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Outbox solves the &quot;Postgres committed, Kafka publish failed&quot; dual-write bug.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;There's no Kafka publish at submit time for scheduled jobs&lt;/span&gt;, so there's no dual-write to fix.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Why&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;runNow&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;does need an outbox&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Trace&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;runNow&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-