nstant-variable: #4FC1FF; --ui-default-code-tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__content&quot; style=&quot;min-width: fit-content; contain: layout style;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Job Svc → Postgres (jobs row only)         ← no outbox&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;       (Watcher tick scans Postgres)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;              Redis ZSET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;           Picker pops at fire_at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;              Kafka&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The Kafka publish happens&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;at fire_at&lt;/span&gt;, not at submit time. The Picker is an&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;async&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;producer — if Kafka is down at submit time, it's not relevant; we only need Kafka to be up at fire_at. There's nothing for the outbox to deliver &quot;atomically with the Postgres insert&quot; because&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;the Kafka event isn't due yet&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Outbox solves the &quot;Postgres committed, Kafka publish failed&quot; dual-write bug.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;There's no Kafka publish at submit time for scheduled jobs&lt;/span&gt;, so there's no dual-write to fix.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Why&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;runNow&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;does need an outbox&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Trace&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;runNow&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 146px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; min-height: 146px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area&quot; data-visibility=&quot;hover&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot; style=&quot;--scrollbar-size: 6px; --scrollbar-inset: 1px; --scrollbar-thumb-top-offset: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__viewport&quot; style=&quot;grid-area: 1 / 1; min-height: 0px; max-height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; overflow: auto hidden; scroll-padding: 0px 4px; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; max-width: none; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code ui-code-block-default-code&quot; style=&quot;min-width: 100%; width: max-content; background: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 156px; padding: 6px 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; contain: layout style paint; tab-size: 4; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --shiki-foreground: #cccccc; --shiki-background: transparent; --shiki-token-constant: #f8c762; --shiki-token-string: #CE9178; --shiki-token-comment: #6A9955; --shiki-token-keyword: #569CD6; --shiki-token-parameter: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-function: #DCDCAA; --shiki-token-string-expression: #CE9178; --shiki-token-punctuation: #cccccc; --shiki-token-link: #87c3ff; --shiki-token-tag: #569CD6; --shiki-token-attribute: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-property: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-type: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-variable: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-class: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-language-variable: #569CD6; --shiki-token-constant-variable: #4FC1FF; --ui-default-code-tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__content&quot; style=&quot;min-width: fit-content; contain: layout style;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Job Svc → Postgres (jobs row + outbox row, ONE txn)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        Outbox Publisher tails outbox&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;              Kafka&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;           Executor runs immediately&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Now Kafka&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;is&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;on the immediate path. If we did&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;Job Svc → Postgres + Job Svc → Kafka&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as two separate writes, we have the v1 dual-write bug back — the same one we just removed. So&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;runNow&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;goes through outbox.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;That's the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;whole reason&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;the outbox exists in this design: to handle&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;runNow&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;and any other &quot;must fire now&quot; path safely.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-f