position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;       finished_at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; NOW&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;WHERE  id     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; $job_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;  AND  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;CANCEL_REQUESTED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The CAS on&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;status='CANCEL_REQUESTED'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;ensures we only land in&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;CANCELLED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;if the cancel really was requested — defends against stale Redis flags or racing writers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The full state machine:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 186px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; min-height: 186px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area&quot; data-visibility=&quot;hover&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot; style=&quot;--scrollbar-size: 6px; --scrollbar-inset: 1px; --scrollbar-thumb-top-offset: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__viewport&quot; style=&quot;grid-area: 1 / 1; min-height: 0px; max-height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; overflow: auto hidden; scroll-padding: 0px 4px; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; max-width: none; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code ui-code-block-default-code&quot; style=&quot;min-width: 100%; width: max-content; background: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 196px; padding: 6px 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; contain: layout style paint; tab-size: 4; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --shiki-foreground: #cccccc; --shiki-background: transparent; --shiki-token-constant: #f8c762; --shiki-token-string: #CE9178; --shiki-token-comment: #6A9955; --shiki-token-keyword: #569CD6; --shiki-token-parameter: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-function: #DCDCAA; --shiki-token-string-expression: #CE9178; --shiki-token-punctuation: #cccccc; --shiki-token-link: #87c3ff; --shiki-token-tag: #569CD6; --shiki-token-attribute: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-property: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-type: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-variable: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-class: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-language-variable: #569CD6; --shiki-token-constant-variable: #4FC1FF; --ui-default-code-tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__content&quot; style=&quot;min-width: fit-content; contain: layout style;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;   SCHEDULED ──cancel──&amp;gt; CANCELLED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;       │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;       ↓ (picker pops)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    QUEUED ──cancel──&amp;gt; CANCELLED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;       │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;       ↓ (executor claims)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    RUNNING ──cancel──&amp;gt; CANCEL_REQUESTED ──executor acks──&amp;gt; CANCELLED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;                              └── grace period expires ──&amp;gt; CANCELLED (forced)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;What if the executor&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;doesn't&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;cooperate?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;This is the failure mode interviewers love to probe. Three scenarios, three answers:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.15em; line-height: 1.25; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); margin-top: 18px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Scenario A — User code is stuck in a blocking call&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Example: user job is doing&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;httpClient.get(url)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;with a 10-minute timeout, and the cancel flag check is in the outer loop. The executor literally cannot check until that call returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Mitigation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;The executor harness uses&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;interruptible primitives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;wherever possible. Wrap user code in a&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;Future&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;and on cancel, call&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;future.cancel(true)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;which sends a thread interrupt. Most JVM blocking I/O honors interrupts (&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;InterruptibleChannel&lt;/code&gt;). For HTTP clients that don't, set aggressive socket-level timeouts.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;You document this in the user contract&lt;/span&gt;: &quot;Your job code must be interruption-tolerant.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.15em; line-height: 1.25; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); margin-top: 18px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Scenario B — Network partition between executor and Redis&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Cancel flag is set in Redis but executor can't see it. The executor's lease renewal still hits Postgres, though, so on next renewal it sees&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;status='CANCEL_REQUESTED'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;and exits the same way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;This is why the protocol uses&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;both&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;signals: Redis is the fast path (sub-second), Postgres is the slow but reliable backstop (every lease renewal, ~10 s).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.15em; line-height: 1.25; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); margin-top: 18px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Scenario C — Executor pod crashed mid-job, never sees cancel&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The lease expires (~30 s). Sweeper notices an expired lease on a&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;CANCEL_REQUESTED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;row and:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 106px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; min-height: 106px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area&quot; data-visibility=&quot;hover&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot; style=&quot;--scrollbar-size: 6px; --scrollbar-inset: 1px; --scrollbar-thumb-top-offset: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__viewport&quot; style=&quot;grid-area: 1 / 1; min-height: 0px; max-height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; overflow: auto hidden; scroll-padding: 0px 4px; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; max-width: none; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code ui-code-block-default-code&quot; style=&quot;min-width: 100%; width: max-content; background: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 116px; padding: 6px 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; contain: layout style paint; tab-size: 4; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --shiki-foreground: #cccccc; --shiki-background: transparent; --shiki-token-constant: #f8c762; --shiki-token-string: #CE9178; --shiki-token-comment: #6A9955; --shiki-token-keyword: #569CD6; --shiki-token-parameter: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-function: #DCDCAA; --shiki-token-string-expression: #CE9178; --shiki-token-punctuation: #cccccc; --shiki-token-link: #87c3ff; --shiki-token-tag: #569CD6; --shiki-token-attribute: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-property: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-type: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-variable: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-class: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-language-variable: #569CD6; --shiki-token-constant-variable: #4FC1FF; --ui-default-code-tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__content&quot; style=&quot;min-width: fit-content; contain: layout style;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;UPDATE jobs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;SET    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;CANCELLED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;, finished_at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; NOW&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;WHERE  id &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; $job_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;  AND  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;CANCEL_REQUESTED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;  AND  lease_expires_at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; NOW&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;No requeue (don't retry a cancelled job). Status becomes terminal&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;CANCELLED&lt;/code&gt;. ✅&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The &quot;kill -9 escape hatch&quot; (grace period)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;For the case where the user's code genuinely refuses to die — say, a runaway tight CPU loop with no I/O — you add a&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;grace period timeout&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 106px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block-content&quot; style=&quot;