tem&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Executor crashed mid-job → never marked terminal status → row stuck in&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;RUNNING&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Lease was set with&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;lease_expires_at = now + 30s&lt;/code&gt;; executor didn't renew it&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Sweeper&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(every few seconds):&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 66px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; min-height: 66px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area&quot; data-visibility=&quot;hover&quot; data-direction=&quot;horizontal&quot; style=&quot;--scrollbar-size: 6px; --scrollbar-inset: 1px; --scrollbar-thumb-top-offset: 6px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template: 1fr / 1fr;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__viewport&quot; style=&quot;grid-area: 1 / 1; min-height: 0px; max-height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; overflow: auto hidden; scroll-padding: 0px 4px; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__content&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; max-width: none; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code ui-code-block-default-code&quot; style=&quot;min-width: 100%; width: max-content; background: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 76px; padding: 6px 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; contain: layout style paint; tab-size: 4; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --shiki-foreground: #cccccc; --shiki-background: transparent; --shiki-token-constant: #f8c762; --shiki-token-string: #CE9178; --shiki-token-comment: #6A9955; --shiki-token-keyword: #569CD6; --shiki-token-parameter: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-function: #DCDCAA; --shiki-token-string-expression: #CE9178; --shiki-token-punctuation: #cccccc; --shiki-token-link: #87c3ff; --shiki-token-tag: #569CD6; --shiki-token-attribute: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-property: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-type: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-variable: #9CDCFE; --shiki-token-class: #4EC9B0; --shiki-token-language-variable: #569CD6; --shiki-token-constant-variable: #4FC1FF; --ui-default-code-tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__content&quot; style=&quot;min-width: fit-content; contain: layout style;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;UPDATE jobs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;SET &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;SCHEDULED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;, attempts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;attempts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(248, 199, 98);&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;, fire_at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;WHERE &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;RUNNING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; AND lease_expires_at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; AND attempts &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; max_attempts;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Job re-enters scheduling pipeline → another Executor instance picks it up&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;If was&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;CANCEL_REQUESTED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;with expired lease → Sweeper finalizes to&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;CANCELLED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(no requeue)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;8. Watcher Fallback Flow (best-effort ZADD missed)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Job Svc's&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;ZADD … NX&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;failed (Redis blip, network) → Postgres committed but Redis has nothing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Within ≤ 60 s,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Watcher&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;tick scans Postgres for&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;fire_at BETWEEN now AND now+5min&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Issues&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;ZADD … NX&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for missing entries&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Job fires up to ~60 s late instead of within 2 s —&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;SLO miss, not data loss&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Same Watcher path catches: cold-start of Redis, ZSET key eviction, shard reassignment&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;9. Control-Plane Failover Flow (etcd-driven)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Picker / Watcher pods hold&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;shard leases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;in etcd (TTL 3 s, heartbeat 1 s)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Pod crashes → heartbeat stops → lease expires after ≤ 3 s&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Surviving pods detect via etcd watch → grab orphaned lease(s) via CAS on lease key&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;New owner cold-starts on that shard:&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Watcher: next 1-min tick re-populates Redis ZSET from Postgres for its owned shards&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Picker: next 100-ms tick begins popping from Redis for its owned shards&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Bounded outage:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;≤ 3 s for that shard; other shards unaffected&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;No double-dispatch — only one pod owns each shard at any moment&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;10. Outbox Publishing Flow (the second orchestration loop)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Outbox Publisher polls / tails&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;outbox&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;table for&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;published=false&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;rows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Produces to Kafka with&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;key=job_id&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(idempotent dedupe key)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;On Kafka ack →&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;UPDATE outbox SET published=true, published_at=now() WHERE id=row&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;On Kafka failure → row stays&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;published=false&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ retried on next loop&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Consumer side dedupes by&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;job_id&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(so re-publishes after crash are safe)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Also publishes lifecycle events:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename&quot;&gt;job.completed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename&quot;&gt;job.failed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename&quot;&gt;job.cancelled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(if external subscribers exist)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;11. Hot-Shard / Backpressure Flow (a flow most people miss)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Single shard receives traffic spike → its Redis ZSET grows faster than Picker drains&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Detection: Picker exposes&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;redis_zset_depth&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;per shard; alert when depth &amp;gt; N or Picker tick latency &amp;gt; 50 ms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Auto-mitigations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;in priority order:&lt;ol class=&quot;list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;ordered-list&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Increase tick parallelism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for that shard (run a second Picker thread on the same shard with split score ranges)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Split the shard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(re-shard hot tenant into 2× shards via etcd lease redistribution)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Per-tenant rate limit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;at API GW (token bucket per tenant_id) — sheds load before it enters&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Worst case: Picker keeps draining at 100 ms cadence, depth grows, jobs fire late but&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;eventually run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;12. Backpressure / DLQ Flow on Kafka or Postgres saturation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;If Kafka produce stalls (broker pressure, ISR shrink): Picker buffers, eventually pauses → Watcher backstop continues populating ZSET → SLO degrades but no data loss&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;If Postgres write throughput saturates (Job Svc): API GW returns 503; clients with&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;Idempotency-Key&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;retry safely&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;If everything stays hot for too long: jobs fire late (precision SLO miss, not correctness miss). The system is&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;eventually correct, eventually on-time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;— this is the design's guarantee.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-sp