lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__scrollbar&quot; data-scrollable=&quot;true&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;position: absolute; z-index: 10; inset: auto 0px 0px; width: auto; pointer-events: auto; height: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-scroll-area__thumb&quot; style=&quot;position: absolute; inset: 0px auto 0px 0px; min-height: auto; width: 573px; border-radius: 9999px; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); pointer-events: auto; transform: translateX(0px); transition: background-color 0.15s, opacity 0.15s; height: 6px; min-width: 20px; opacity: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 6px 0px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;That covers every flow the v2 design supports. The four you specifically asked about (good / error / retry / cancel / immediate) are #1, #5, #6, #4, #2 — and the other six (cron, stuck-job sweeper, watcher fallback, etcd failover, outbox publish, hot-shard backpressure) are the ones that come up as follow-up questions in interviews.&lt;/p&gt;" link="&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 0px 0px 6px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Here's the full set of flows in crisp form. The components referenced map directly to the v2 diagram boxes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;1. Good Flow — Scheduled Job (&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;fire_at&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;in future)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Client → API GW →&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Job Svc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Job Svc →&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Postgres&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;INSERT jobs (status='SCHEDULED', shard, fire_minute)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(single txn, no outbox)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Job Svc →&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Redis ZSET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;ZADD due:{shard} NX &amp;lt;fire_at&amp;gt; &amp;lt;job_id&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;(best-effort, only if&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;fire_at ≤ 5 min&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Job Svc → Client&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;201 Created {job_id}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Watcher&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(1-min tick on owned shards) → scans Postgres&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;WHERE fire_at BETWEEN now AND now+5min&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;ZADD … NX&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(catches anything Job Svc missed)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Picker&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(100 ms tick on owned shards) → Redis Lua: atomic&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;ZRANGEBYSCORE 0 now&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;+&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;ZREM&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ produce to&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;md-inline-path-filename&quot;&gt;scheduler.dispatch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Job Consumer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ poll Kafka → CAS&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;UPDATE jobs SET status='RUNNING', lease_expires_at=now+30s WHERE id=X AND status='QUEUED'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Executor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ run user code → CAS&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;UPDATE jobs SET status='SUCCEEDED'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ commit Kafka offset&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Latency budget:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;picker tick 100ms + Lua 10ms + Kafka 20ms + consumer 100ms + worker startup 200ms → well under 2 s p99.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;2. Immediate /&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;runNow&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Flow&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Client → API GW → Job Svc&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Job Svc →&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Postgres&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;single txn&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;writes&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;TWO rows&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;INSERT jobs (status='QUEUED', fire_at=now)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;INSERT outbox (topic='scheduler.dispatch', key=job_id, payload=...)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Outbox Publisher&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(CDC tail or polling) → reads outbox row → produce to Kafka → mark outbox row&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;published=true&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Job Consumer → claim CAS → Executor runs → terminal status&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Skips&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Redis ZSET, Watcher, Picker — bypasses the scheduling pipeline entirely&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Why the outbox here:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Kafka publish is on the immediate path → solves the dual-write problem&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;3. Cron / Recurring Flow&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;First submission: Cron Emitter computes&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;next_fire_at = nextCronFire(now, expr, tz)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ INSERT row with that&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;md-inline-variable-like&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;fire_at&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ flows like a scheduled job&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;At dispatch time, in&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;the same Postgres txn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as marking SUCCEEDED:&lt;div class=&quot;composer-message-codeblock&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; border-radius: 8px; border-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); border-style: solid; border-width: 0.833333px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); min-height: 86px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-code-block-content&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; min-