ass=&quot;ui-default-code__line&quot; style=&quot;display: flex; min-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ui-default-code__line-content&quot; style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding-left: 6px; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-right: 8px; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;WHERE id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;X AND &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt; IN (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;SCHEDULED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;QUEUED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 145, 120);&quot;&gt;RUNNING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Job Svc → Redis&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;SET cancel:{id} 1 EX 3600&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;(fast signal, best-effort, after Postgres commit)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Then split by current state:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;4a — was&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;SCHEDULED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ status becomes&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;CANCELLED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;directly. Picker's Lua skips cancelled jobs at pop time. Watcher won't re-ZADD. Done.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;4b — was&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;QUEUED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(Kafka message in flight) → status&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;CANCELLED&lt;/code&gt;. Job Consumer pulls message, CAS&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;WHERE status='QUEUED'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;returns 0 rows → drops message silently.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;4c — was&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;RUNNING&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ status&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;CANCEL_REQUESTED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(transition state). Executor's polling loop checks&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;cancel:{id}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;every 1–5 s → on hit: cleanup → user&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;onCancel()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;hook → CAS&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;status='CANCELLED' WHERE status='CANCEL_REQUESTED'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ release lease.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin: 6px 0px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot; style=&quot;--tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Backstops&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;if executor never sees the flag:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-left: 2em; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin: 6px 0px !important; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Lease expires → Sweeper finalizes&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;CANCEL_REQUESTED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;padding: 1.5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; background-color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.08); color: color(srgb 0.8 0.8 0.8 / 0.94); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all;&quot;&gt;CANCELLED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot; style=&quot;padding-block: 4px; word-break: break-word; padding: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Grace period (60 s) → optional pod kill via Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-2&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.3em; margin-top: 20px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;5. Error / Failure Flow — target returns 5xx or worker throws&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot; style=&quot;--tw-space-y-reverse: 0; margin-block: 0px 16px; list-style-type: disc; white-space: normal; padding-l